    <tags>bishare file-transfer file-sharing airdrop p2p encryption cross-platform portable</tags>
    <summary>Fast, private, cross-platform file sharing — AirDrop for every device</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Send files between Windows, iPhone, Android, Mac and Linux — directly over your own Wi-Fi, end-to-end encrypted (X25519 + AES-256-GCM), at local network speed. Nothing uploads to the cloud, nothing is recompressed, and the other person needs no account: they can receive in a plain browser.

When they're not nearby, share an encrypted link (up to 100 GB, expires after 24 hours). Free and open source (MIT), no ads, no sign-up.

This package installs the portable Windows build from the official GitHub release and adds a Start Menu shortcut.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/BIShare-project/bishare-flutter/releases</releaseNotes>
